  m_text: "The hand-in is a 1920 \xD7 1080 video: 16:9, landscape. Most of the references are portrait. The half-transparent picture in front of this camera is reference 29, as tall as the frame.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Look through this camera. What fills the two sides of the 16:9 frame, where the reference shows nothing?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Recompose the shot for 16:9: move the camera, the pole and the figure until the sides are part of the picture. Switch the reference picture off to check.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reference 29</color></size>"
