  m_text: "Three settings on the Camera decide what it draws besides the scene. Environment \u203A Background Type: what fills the pixels where nothing is drawn, a sky or one colour (see the Sky Room). Rendering \u203A Post Processing: whether this camera applies post-processing. Environment \u203A Volume Mask: which Volume layers this camera reads (see group 5).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Untick Post Processing on this camera. What changes in its picture, and what stays the same?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Set Background Type to Solid Color and choose a dark blue. Does any surface in the scene get lighter?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
