  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Fog dims what lies behind it and adds the light that reaches it. Where the wall casts a shadow into the fog, no light is added; the lit air between the shadows is a shaft. Fog scatters light mostly forward, in the direction the light travels.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> A light shines through the slit from behind the wall. Seen looking toward the light, and seen looking away from it, where is the shaft brighter?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Walk the camera around the shaft. Then change Anisotropy on the light's Volumetric Additional Light component.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 05-11, Liminal kit B \xB7 Slit wall</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
