  m_text: "The camera draws only what lies between its two clipping planes, Near and Far (Projection \u203A Clipping Planes). Nothing beyond Far is drawn.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> This camera has Far set to 40 m. The avenue is about 150 m long. What happens at the end of the road?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Raise Far until the end of the avenue shows. Later, fog can hide where the drawing stops (see the Sky Room)."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
