  m_text: "Post-processing works on the finished image, not on the scene. These five cameras show the same frame. Each reads Volumes only on the layers in its Volume Mask: 1 none (raw), 2 + Tonemapping, 3 + Bloom, 4 + Grading, 5 + Vignette and grain.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Compare the five pictures. Which step changed the lights in the scene?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Select a camera and change its Volume Mask (Environment \u203A Volumes \u203A Volume Mask). Watch which effects it picks up.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 26-29</color></size>"
