  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A camera tilted up makes vertical lines lean toward each other. A Physical Camera can move the picture instead of turning: tick Projection \u203A Physical Camera, then use Lens \u203A Shift. The camera stays level, so verticals stay vertical.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> This camera is tilted up to fit the whole arch. How do the arch's two legs look in its picture?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Set the camera's Rotation X to 0. Tick Physical Camera and raise Shift Y until the whole arch fits again. Compare the legs.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, B \xB7 Arch</color></size>"
